<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="TV Finder searches the TVMaze API for TV show information." />
  <title>TV Finder | TVMaze Search Tool</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#results">Skip to results</a>
  <header class="hero">
    <nav class="nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <p class="logo">TV Finder</p>
      <a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
    </nav>
    <section class="hero-content">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Powered by the TVMaze API</p>
        <h1>Search TV shows instantly.</h1>
        <p class="intro">Find show summaries, genres, ratings, status and premiere dates using live data from TVMaze.</p>
        <form id="searchForm" class="search-panel" aria-label="Search for a TV show">
          <label for="searchInput">Enter a TV show name</label>
          <div class="search-row">
            <input id="searchInput" name="search" type="search" placeholder="e.g. Breaking Bad" required autocomplete="off" />
            <button type="submit">Search</button>
          </div>
          <p id="formHelp">Try searches such as Friends, The Office, Loki or Doctor Who.</p>
        </form>
      </div>
      <aside class="hero-card" aria-label="Website features">
        <h2>Features</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Live API search</li>
          <li>Responsive card layout</li>
          <li>Accessible form labels</li>
          <li>Error and loading states</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </section>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section id="how-it-works" class="info-section">
      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <p>Type a programme name and the site sends a JavaScript fetch request to the TVMaze search endpoint. The returned JSON is converted into readable HTML cards.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="results-section" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Results</p>
          <h2 id="results-title">Search results</h2>
        </div>
        <button id="clearBtn" class="secondary" type="button">Clear</button>
      </div>
      <div id="statusMessage" class="status">Search for a show to begin.</div>
      <div id="results" class="results-grid" aria-label="TV show results"></div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>Data supplied by <a href="https://www.tvmaze.com/api">TVMaze</a>. Student web design assessment project.</p>
  </footer>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
